The official bare, structural-hint, and placebo transcripts have now been regenerated for the revised parameters. All three are correctly script-owned, but OpenRouter rejected every draw with the same quota error, so the arms remain “0 valid attempts,” not “0/3 solved.” I’m doing a broader deterministic-generation fuzz pass next and then will rewrite the README around the revised dense-error construction and this honest external-blocker status.
