The revised module now passes all local gates: unique planted solutions, exact enumeration on demo/easy, 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses, five failed attacks, reference decoder 8/8 as expected, fixed 95-bit answers under scaling, and 60 canonical-key invariance checks. I’m stress-testing more seeds next, then I’ll invoke the script-owned oracle loop; the prior artifacts show the workspace key was quota-blocked, so I’ll treat any repeat 403 as infrastructure failure, not hardness evidence.
