codex
The live oracle confirms the ladder is behaving as intended: `easy` was solved, so the harness has escalated rather than treating that rung as shipping evidence. The 200-seed stress test also found the obvious plurality/medoid heuristics can crack some easy instances but 0/200 medium and 0/200 hard instances; those easy-rung failures will be recorded in the README.
