codex
Two of three easy attempts have failed. The third is underway; if it fails too, the held level has only a 16-bit answer space, but G4 at that rung would not pass the required random-guess threshold (1/65,536). In that case I will not ship it blindly—I’ll move the same construction to a larger fixed-answer rung and obtain fresh oracle evidence there.
